This folder contains the cp/m 1.4 files recovered from the original disk images. 
Minimal differences were ignored, in case of custom file markings etc, the generic file copy was chosen.

Some of the TRS80 specific stuff was adjusted to work around the character set, OS specific versions have been renamed accordingly.

'ed_trs80_lifeboat_fix' is a modified version of ED for the LifeBoat CP/M 1.4, which isn't able to get CTRL+Z keypress, it is remapped to work with CTRL+_
